## Usage

### 1. Run the local vulnerable target (Optional Demo)
In one terminal window, start the local test target:
```bash
python test_server.py
```
This launches a test server at `http://127.0.0.1:5000`.

### 2. Audit a website or local server
In another terminal, run the scanner:
```bash
python scanner.py [http://127.0.0.1:5000](http://127.0.0.1:5000) -o report.json
```

Or scan any public domain:
```bash
python scanner.py [https://example.com](https://example.com) -o example_report.json
```

